title: "GramStatTexNet (GSTN)"
abstract: >-
  Texture analysis-by-synthesis from a steerable pyramid and pairwise sub-band
  correlations, decomposable by statistic family, and extending to video by
  swapping in a spatiotemporal filter bank.
